+
+Complaint-driven investigations dominate across the board, but public bodies face a higher mix of ex officio probes.
+![Article5 Heatmap.Png](outputs/analysis/public_vs_private/article5_heatmap.png)
+
+Heatmap reveals which substantive GDPR principles most frequently appear in findings against each entity type.
+![Rights Heatmap.Png](outputs/analysis/public_vs_private/rights_heatmap.png)
+
+Heatmap reveals which substantive GDPR principles most frequently appear in findings against each entity type.
+![Powers Comparison.Png](outputs/analysis/public_vs_private/powers_comparison.png)
+
+Public-sector decisions rely more heavily on reprimands and compliance orders, while private organizations more often face fines.
